[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2597937681","pull_request_review_id":3551207419,"id":2597937681,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6a2WIR","diff_hunk":"@@ -215,6 +215,7 @@\n \t\t<member name=\"current_tab\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_current_tab\" getter=\"get_current_tab\" default=\"-1\">\n \t\t\tThe current tab index. When set, this index's [Control] node's [code]visible[/code] property is set to [code]true[/code] and all others are set to [code]false[/code].\n \t\t\tA value of [code]-1[/code] means that no tab is selected.\n+\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property before [TabContainer] is in the scene tree will not switch the tab, even if the index is within bounds (but the property will still be assigned). The actual switch will happen when the container enters the tree.","path":"doc/classes/TabContainer.xml","commit_id":"dbf44d9bf994bd55d4ce927210edc5b775502cd6","original_commit_id":"dbf44d9bf994bd55d4ce927210edc5b775502cd6","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion